{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-returnToMansion-10017": "JEROME: 月光蝶怎么从罐子里飞出去了……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-returnToMansion-10018": "CARNEAU: 呃啊！啊啊啊！咔啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-returnToMansion-10019": "JEROME: 卡尔诺警佐？你没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-returnToMansion-10020": "JEROME: 这到底……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10021": "GEORGE: 哦，你好，什么时候回来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10022": "NEVILLE: 我嘴里……有朵玫瑰……全是玫瑰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10023": "JEROME: 发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10024": "GEORGE: 出了点魔法上的乱子，说来惭愧，我起初还没察觉，今天一早其实就没怎么留意周围的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10025": "内维尔怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10026": "GEORGE: 一开始我以为只是宿醉得厉害，直到试着从门口出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10027": "GEORGE: 现在看来，是有人把我们卷进了一个格外复杂的法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10028": "见到其他人了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10029": "GEORGE: 安娜贝尔来过，看起来很担心，她很擅长魔法，又是在这里长大的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10030": "GEORGE: 她急匆匆说了句，这是什么宅邸的“魔法迷宫”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10031": "JEROME: 她怎么进出这里的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10032": "GEORGE: 和你一样，突然出现……又消失在房间东南角。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10033": "GEORGE: 我可没把握跟过去，不过午餐时间快到了，也许会改主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10034": "我该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George2-10035": "GEORGE: 相信你很快就能解决。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10036": "WILLIAM: 哦！医生！能想想办法吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10037": "JEROME: 出什么事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10038": "WILLIAM: 琳达和哈里神志不清了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10039": "WILLIAM: 琳达说不出话，我还得拼命拦着哈里，不让他往墙上撞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10040": "和魔法迷宫同时发生的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10041": "WILLIAM: 稍早一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10042": "见到其他人，或听到什么消息了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10043": "WILLIAM: 安娜贝尔从你来的地方进来过，走得很急，看着很不安。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10044": "WILLIAM: 她消失在书架上方那座枝形烛台后面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10045": "WILLIAM: 哦！还见到了斯托克斯，真没想到，不过他一心在找凯瑟琳夫人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10046": "WILLIAM: 谁要是知道怎么在宅子里走，那肯定是管家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10047": "那我先失陪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-William2-10048": "WILLIAM: 当然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10049": "ARMAND: 雷诺医生！还有别人来帮忙吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10050": "这里发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10051": "ARMAND: 有人施了群体混乱法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10052": "JEROME: 你确定？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10053": "ARMAND: 当然，我以前碰上过一场抢劫，劫匪用的就是这种法术，只要中过一次，就再也忘不了那种感觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10054": "JEROME: 可你没受影响？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10055": "ARMAND: 自从首都那场灾难后，我就一直定时加固身上的防护结界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10056": "ARMAND: 我也劝过母亲，可她显然没听进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10057": "看见其他人经过吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10058": "ARMAND: 没有，不过听见凯瑟琳夫人和朱莉娅在走廊里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10059": "JEROME: 朱莉娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10060": "ARMAND: 对，她和姨母吵得很大声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10061": "ARMAND: 好像在说“必须现在就走”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10062": "我得走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Armand2-10063": "ARMAND: 看看房间角落，魔法迷宫的缺口通常在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10064": "WARREN: 雷诺医生？你怎么在这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10065": "出什么事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10066": "WARREN: 有人启动了宅邸的魔法迷宫，我一下就认出来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10067": "WARREN: 可惜我不记得怎么走了，上次发生这种事，我还是个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10068": "谁会知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10069": "WARREN: 斯托克斯或安娜贝尔，大概知道怎么走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10070": "见过凯瑟琳或朱莉娅吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10071": "WARREN: 没见到，不过听见她们上二楼时，聊得兴高采烈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10072": "WARREN: 她们居然处得来，我就觉得可疑，毕竟凯瑟琳一直怨恨祖父第三个家庭的所有人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10073": "第三个家庭？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10074": "WARREN: 祖父至少结过三次婚，那老风流鬼！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10075": "WARREN: 朱莉娅是他最小、也最宠爱的孙辈，老头一蹬腿，她就能继承这宅子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10076": "WARREN: 我父亲继承另一栋。姑母只能去和亡夫的家族争一栋他们家的房子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10077": "凯瑟琳会伤害朱莉娅吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10078": "WARREN: 我想姑母还不敢见血，可她一向诡计多端。可怜朱莉娅连一点魔法都用不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10079": "我得走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10080": "WARREN: 当然。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren2-10081": "WARREN: 出口就在这个角落里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10082": "LISETTE: 雷诺医生！糟透了，宅邸的魔法正把斯托克斯先生折腾得厉害！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10083": "STOKES: 它……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10084": "STOKES: 时有时无。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10085": "JEROME: 凯瑟琳夫人在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10086": "STOKES: 我真的不知道，迷宫变成这样，两个人我都找不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10087": "JEROME: 你是管家，遇到这种情况总该有办法通行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10088": "STOKES: 为了大家安全，最好还是等——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10089": "LISETTE: 斯托克斯先生！求您了！警察会找我们麻烦的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10090": "STOKES: 好吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10091": "STOKES: 拿着这个，它能显示魔法迷宫的结构，还能打开一些新路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette2-10092": "LISETTE: 请快些，雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes2-10093": "STOKES: 相信您会谨慎使用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10094": "FABIEN: 雷诺医生？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10095": "JEROME: 见到凯瑟琳夫人了吗？我怀疑这一切都是她引起的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10096": "FABIEN: 没有，安娜贝尔跑去找她们了，我可不想跟魔法迷宫较劲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10097": "FABIEN: 再说，对付魔法，她比我有本事得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10098": "JEROME: 她去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10099": "FABIEN: 刚又从这里经过，提了什么舅舅的宅子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10100": "FABIEN: 从那边又进迷宫了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10101": "FABIEN: 她舅舅和这里的事有什么关系，我不知道，反正这一家子向来乱得离谱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Fabien2-10102": "FABIEN: 请帮帮安娜贝尔，她想阻止一场丑闻，甚至可能是更糟的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10103": "ANABEL: 雷诺医生！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10104": "JEROME: 安娜贝尔，这里到底怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10105": "ANABEL: 母亲又在算计朱莉娅，这次恐怕真会伤到人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10106": "她想对朱莉娅做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10107": "ANABEL: 朱莉娅最得外祖父宠爱，将来要继承宅子……也许就是这几天。母亲为这事耿耿于怀多年了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10108": "她以前就对朱莉娅做过什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10109": "ANABEL: 是。她和舅舅串通，让朱莉娅在另一个世界出生，这样就不会有魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10110": "为什么不想让朱莉娅拥有魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10111": "ANABEL: 外祖父去世后就会分配遗产，房子是一回事，可他真正的遗赠是魔法传承。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10112": "ANABEL: 他有大量魔法器物和法术书，甚至还有死后依然有效、可以传承的强大附魔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10113": "ANABEL: 母亲让朱莉娅没有魔法，外祖父的传承对她就没用了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10114": "你觉得她会伤害朱莉娅吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10115": "ANABEL: 不知道，她也许想在遗嘱认证期间把朱莉娅关在什么地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10116": "ANABEL: 也可能向她提出了某种交易，可和我母亲做交易，永远占不到便宜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10117": "你现在在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10118": "ANABEL: 想找到去舅舅家那条捷径。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel2-10119": "ANABEL: 不过，母亲似乎特意把我排除在迷宫和传送门的通行权限之外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionKnockbackRight-10120": "JEROME: 看这法术的力量，得另找条路过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionKnockbackLeft-10121": "JEROME: 看这法术的力量，得另找条路过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville2-10122": "NEVILLE: 花园，一整片花园，全是常春藤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Linda2-10123": "LINDA: 停、停、停……让火、火车停下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Harry2-10124": "HARRY: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Henrietta2-10125": "HENRIETTA: 真不错……在听觉上边……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10126": "ANABEL: 不知道能不能到舅舅家，不过带你们去传送门，应该没问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10127": "ANABEL: 请跟我来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10128": "JEROME: 安娜贝尔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10129": "ANABEL: 我困在这边了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10130": "ANABEL: 母亲果然专门在迷宫里设了针对我的结界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10131": "ANABEL: 我不会有事，可朱莉娅未必，你们得阻止她们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-anabelOpens-10132": "ANABEL: 我会让一个出口显现出来，你们若需要为接下来的事做些准备，可以先从那里出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-warpedMansionExit-10133": "离开并返回世界地图？（之后可直接返回本房间。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-warpedMansionExit-10134": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-warpedMansionExit-10135": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredWhereIs-10136": "JEROME: 人都在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-seeWhiskersAgain-10137": "WHISKERS: 这边！快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-seeWhiskersAgain-10138": "JEROME: 你要带我们去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-seeWhiskersAgain-10139": "WHISKERS: 杰赛亚真正的家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10140": "JEROME: 这里是哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10141": "NIKOLAI: 应该是我的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10142": "WHISKERS: 杰赛亚曾和他的第一个家庭住在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10143": "WHISKERS: 他的妻子来自东方，世界分裂时，她和孩子们一同消失了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10144": "WHISKERS: 他花了几十年才找到回这里的办法，可那时已经太迟了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10145": "WHISKERS: 阿尔弗雷德和凯瑟琳就在前面，杰赛亚的房间里。他们不让我插手，可不是你们的对手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersInEthos-10146": "WHISKERS: 请救救朱莉娅，她要有个闪失，老头会心碎的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-whiskersEthosNPC-10147": "WHISKERS: 请救救朱莉娅，她要有个闪失，老头会心碎的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10148": "ALFRED: 你打算怎么向当局解释！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10149": "CATHERINE: 我会说朱莉娅选择追随她的外祖父，她已经成年，有权自行决定。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10150": "JEROME: 追随他去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10151": "ALFRED: 杰赛亚……不知怎么……拿到了一只月光蝶，完成了最后的法术，打开了通往另一世界的门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10152": "ALFRED: 他年事已高，就算冒险，也没多少可失去的，可朱莉娅不一样，她也跟着进去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10153": "BEN: 不就是去了我的世界？也只有那边没你们家的房子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10154": "BEN: 她唯一应付不来的，大概就是好好调过味的饭菜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10155": "ALFRED: 不是，我们早就推断出了那个有风之圣祠的世界，她没在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10156": "ALFRED: 杰赛亚一直认为，还有第五个世界，魔法起源的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10157": "ALFRED: 现在他打开了通往那里的门……至少他自己这么相信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10158": "ALFRED: 我就知道，临到最后，他可能会干傻事，所以才把他留在这里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10159": "JEROME: （这一家，一个比一个不正常……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10160": "CATHERINE: 朱莉娅跟随外祖父进入那片领域，是想获得自己出生时没能拥有的魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10161": "CATHERINE: 我们难道不该等待，盼她成功吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10162": "JEROME: 入口在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10163": "ALFRED: 左边通道过去，一间被遮蔽的房间里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-wigramConfrontation-10164": "ALFRED: 不管那里是什么地方……你们都比我们更有希望把她救出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-alfredEthos-10165": "ALFRED: 不管那里是什么地方……你们都比我们更有希望把她救出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-catherineEthos-10166": "CATHERINE: 别这么看我，我只是帮助自己的外甥女追求她想要的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10167": "BEN: 好吵！好亮！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10168": "JUNA: 闻起来像闪电和鲜血……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10169": "ALEXANDRA: 连我的牙齿都在震。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10170": "????: 帮帮我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10171": "JEROME: 朱莉娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10172": "JEROME: 杰赛亚！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10173": "JESIAH: 我要去的地方，她还不能跟来，至少现在不能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10174": "JESIAH: 我在她走得太深之前拦住了她，可有个东西跟着回来了，是这个世界的生物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10175": "JESIAH: 我能把它从她体内逼出来，却无法独自击败它，那得靠你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10176": "JEROME: 动手吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10177": "JULIA: 哪儿……发生什么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10178": "JEROME: 我们接住你了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10179": "JULIA: 外公！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10180": "JEROME: 他走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10181": "JULIA: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10182": "JEROME: 我们得离开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10183": "JULIA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10184": "THOMPSON: 你们都听见凯瑟琳夫人说这些话了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10185": "AGATA: 是的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10186": "JEROME: 而且，只有她能把魔法迷宫扭曲成那样，更别说通往另一世界的入口还被锁住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10187": "THOMPSON: 哪怕几个月前发生这种事，都不会有人信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10188": "THOMPSON: 一个人，在三个世界都有房子……想想看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10189": "THOMPSON: 我们可有得忙了，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10190": "ALEXANDRA: 真能证明那位什么夫人，是想除掉自己的外甥女吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10191": "BEN: 是啊，这害人手法也太复杂了，别人能听明白吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10192": "CORDELIA: 我们有审理魔法犯罪的法庭，这类案件的判例很多，也不缺能为陪审团讲解的专家证人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10193": "NIKOLAI: 反正我可不想当这家的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10194": "????: 也不是一直这么糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10195": "WHISKERS: 孩子和孙辈年幼时，杰赛亚总和他们处得很好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10196": "WHISKERS: 可富贵人家的孩子渐渐长大，就开始盘算：要是这一家之主死了，自己能分到些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10197": "WHISKERS: 说到遗产，这个归你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10198": "获得猫咪护符！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10199": "JEROME: 接下来你打算怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10200": "WHISKERS: 回首都去，我以前住在杰赛亚少年时的公寓里，社交生活可是热闹得很。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10201": "JEROME: 原来他还有一处房子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10202": "WHISKERS: 哦，那儿几十年来都只有猫能住，你不会喜欢的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10203": "WHISKERS: 再会，旅人们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-enterFifthDimension-10204": "JEROME: 这趟旅程要是还能更离奇，我可不知道自己承不承受得了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-leftMansionOfficer-10205": "OFFICER: 问话结束之前，所有人原地待着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-CarneauAfter-10206": "CARNEAU: 大多数人很快就能走了，可凯瑟琳夫人难说，她兄弟恐怕也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-ThompsonPathos-10207": "THOMPSON: 但愿这种案子别成常态。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-pathosOfficer-10208": "OFFICER: 这边倒也没那么不同，不过魔法我一直不拿手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionKitchenOfficer-10209": "OFFICER: 这些贵族就算等上一整天，我也不心疼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-jeromeMazeArrival-10210": "JEROME: 有点可疑，看看侦测术能发现什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3532": "Title: 到底是哪门子的世界？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3533": "Description: 查清到底发生了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3534": "Title: 奇异追踪",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3535": "Description: 利用衣柜，跟随凯瑟琳夫人和朱莉娅前往阿尔弗雷德的宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3536": "Title: 第三个世界的麻烦",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3537": "Description: 前往另一个房间，与阿尔弗雷德和凯瑟琳对质。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3538": "Title: 朱莉娅",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3539": "Description: 进入虚空，救出朱莉娅！"
}
